## Screen 1: Battlefield & Pop-Up Overlays (`Home`)

* **Persistent Combat HUD:** As shown above. At Stage 25+, tapping the **Stage Name plaque (`Old Skull Meadow`)** opens a compact tooltip listing current **Biome Hazards & Modifiers** (e.g., *Extreme Cold, The Rusting, Shaking Plague, Damaged Mythal*) and whether your equipped gear counters them.
* **Push / Farm Toggle (`[P]` / `[F]` pill right of Quota Bar):** Locked (`🔒`) during Tutorial Stages 1–25; active from Stage 26 onward to loop a stage for Materials or Bestiary kills.
* **Modal Overlays (Triggered on Battlefield):**
  1. **Elminster / Guide Dialogue Bar (Bottom-Left):** `64×64` carved frame with portrait (Elminster in `1–25`, Alias/Dragonbait in `26–100`, Karlach in `101–200`, Caitlyn in `201–300`, Markham in `301–400`, Deryan Kaya in `401–500`), max 2 lines of text, tap-anywhere advance.
