  5. **Death Save Drama Overlay:** Screen desaturates and slows while three d20s roll sequentially (`≥10` = gold check, `<10` = red skull; Nat 20 = full HP burst!).
  6. **"While You Were Away" Letter (`Stage 19+`):** Sealed parchment letter from Elminster summarizing offline Gold, XP, Stages cleared, and Items salvaged.

