### Inside an Active Campaign Run (Clean 3-Panel Layout)
* **Top Bar — Rules & Mode Banner:** Clearly tells the player: **`"BOUNDED TABLETOP RULES: Training & Prestige Multipliers Paused — Pure Hero Level, Gear & Strategy!"`** + Difficulty selector (*Story / Adventurer / Heroic / Nightmare*) + **Play Mode (`[Tactical Turn Control]` vs `[Smart Gambits Auto]`)**.
* **Left Panel — Party Formation (`1–4 Roster Slots`):** Drag up to 4 characters from your **Guild Roster** (or borrow Story Allies like *Alias* / *Karlach* while your roster is small). Shows shared Short/Long Rest resources (*Action Surge, Second Wind, Spell Slots, Hit Dice*).
* **Center Panel — Branching Node Map (`10–30 Finite Nodes`):** Node icons for **Combat Encounters, Skill Puzzles, Campfire Rests, Moral Choices, Traps, and Darklord / Finale Bosses**.
* **Right Panel — Campaign-Specific Subsystem Slot (Modular Box):** Swaps cleanly depending on the selected module:
  * *For Ravenloft: The Horrors Within:* Displays **Dread & Fear Meter**, **3 Active Tarokka Modifier Cards**, and **Dark Gift Bargain** prompts (power + curse tradeoffs).
  * *For Arcana Unleashed: Deadfall:* Displays **Secrecy / Alertness Meter** (stealth vs loud alerts), **3-Way Arcane Society Intrigue Bars**, and **Evolving Magic Item Milestone Tracker**.
* **Bottom Reward Footer:** Shows the **Permanent Freeplay Unlocks** earned upon completion (e.g., *"+100% Freeplay Damage, Dhampir Lineage Unlocked, Evolving Relic Claimed"*).

