# Summary of Why This UI Scales Cleanly From Stage 1 to Stage 1,000
* **Stage 1 feels effortless:** Players look at one clear battlefield, 1 unlocked tab (`Train`), 1 clickable button (`Weapon Drills R1 · 10 cp`), and 1 exciting goal (`>> Action Surge [2]`).
* **Nothing surprises or hides:** Every padlocked button, tab, drill, upgrade axis, class crest, and campaign card acts as a visible curiosity hook (*"Ooh, what are Gambits at Stage 17? What's Ravenloft at Stage 250?"*).
* **Zero UI redesign needed later:** Adding all 12+1 2024 classes, 48+ subclasses, 14 species/lineages, and full set-length campaigns simply means **snapping off the padlocks** inside pre-built, already-framed screens!